          "title_zh": "智能体集成软件的安全性：当人工操作与智能体动作共存",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.23226v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2609.23226",
          "summary": "The paper argues that the security of agent-integrated software must be assessed at the level of the whole system rather than protecting the agent and conventional software core separately, and organizes the resulting problems into context misuse, authorization violation, execution control, and effect integrity. It reviews where current practice falls short and identifies research directions in information provenance, cross-path policy enforcement, authorization validity over time, and persistent effects and recovery.",
