          "arxiv_id": "2609.23231",
          "summary": "The paper builds a five-language chemical patent retrieval dataset from Google Patents and European Patent Office data and evaluates eight embedding models, finding a substantial monolingual-versus-cross-lingual gap in which the best model's Recall@10 drops from 0.72 to 0.53. It also reports degraded retrieval depth in cross-lingual settings and offers the benchmark as a diagnostic framework for model selection.",
